      "content": "Hey, I'm working on the launch strategy for a new ultra-premium fragrance line for a luxury house. We need to define our core target segments to make sure our ad spend is efficient. Can you help me build out a few \"ideal consumer profiles\"? I need details on their lifestyle, typical values, and even their likely ethnic/cultural backgrounds so we can tailor the visual aesthetic and placement.",
